(7300716, 1138535, 103142, '<td valign="top">This one is intriguing.</td>', 'This one is intriguing.', '2015-01-10 07:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7300717, 1138517, 103142, '<td valign="top">Not sure of the colors. Part of me likes the blue, part of me thinks it''s a tad overwhelming in the photo. But then again, it may make the lint stand out more. Just musing, because I''m curious what it would look like with different processing.</td>', 'Not sure of the colors. Part of me likes the blue, part of me thinks it''s a tad overwhelming in the photo. But then again, it may make the lint stand out more. Just musing, because I''m curious what it would look like with different processing.', '2015-01-10 07:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7300718, 1138332, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I like the soft palette. Our lint is a lot more boring. :( (oh, 9, by the way)</td>', 'Very nice! I like the soft palette. Our lint is a lot more boring. :( (oh, 9, by the way)', '2015-01-10 07:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7300719, 1138299, 103142, '<td valign="top">Just thinking out loud:<br/> <br/>hmmm not quite sure of the composition in this one. I like it when things are off-center, but the tulip is so far left and close to the top that it looks like it''s exiting the photo. I like the color gradient, though your tulips leaves look a little sick with that color. The thought of a lint cozy makes me go: eeeewwww :)</td>', 'Just thinking out loud: hmmm not quite sure of the composition in this one. I like it when things are off-center, but the tulip is so far left and close to the top that it looks like it''s exiting the photo. I like the color gradient, though your tulips leaves look a little sick with that color. The thought of a lint cozy makes me go: eeeewwww :)', '2015-01-10 07:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7300720, 1138460, 103142, '<td valign="top">Just my musings:<br/> <br/>My first thought is: not that interesting of a photo. Not that interesting of a use of lint. But then I read the title. (I have a tendency to pay little attention to titles for the most part. I''m always curious what the photo says without them.)<br/> <br/>But here is a clear case where the title makes the story, puts everything into place, and actually feeds the emotion. What a title is supposed to do, and hardly ever seems to do it. <br/> <br/>I could see a guy pulling things out of his pocket and leaving the lint with the items. It added such a human element to it, I wanted to look more. I noticed the old nickel immediately -- didn''t know how old, but it was so worn. Then I noticed the wheat pennies. Was this a memory from a long time ago with the old coins? Or did dad empty his change collection to go traveling one more time with son?<br/> <br/>Not sure I like the shadows coming down toward me. <br/> <br/>You took a 5 photo to an 8 because of a story that worked well.</td>', 'Just my musings: My first thought is: not that interesting of a photo. Not that interesting of a use of lint. But then I read the title. (I have a tendency to pay little attention to titles for the most part. I''m always curious what the photo says without them.) But here is a clear case where the title makes the story, puts everything into place, and actually feeds the emotion. What a title is supposed to do, and hardly ever seems to do it.  I could see a guy pulling things out of his pocket and leaving the lint with the items. It added such a human element to it, I wanted to look more. I noticed the old nickel immediately -- didn''t know how old, but it was so worn. Then I noticed the wheat pennies. Was this a memory from a long time ago with the old coins? Or did dad empty his change collection to go traveling one more time with son? Not sure I like the shadows coming down toward me.  You took a 5 photo to an 8 because of a story that worked well.', '2015-01-10 07:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7300721, 1138488, 103142, '<td valign="top">I do like the wig. It is a wonderful wig. But the background is so busy, it really distracts. Plus, the see through border makes it even busier. I do like the color palette quite a bit, but I wish that it was a more shallow depth of field, or something to make it less immediate. 5 for the shot, but the wig is wonderful enough to bump it up to a 6</td>', 'I do like the wig. It is a wonderful wig. But the background is so busy, it really distracts. Plus, the see through border makes it even busier. I do like the color palette quite a bit, but I wish that it was a more shallow depth of field, or something to make it less immediate. 5 for the shot, but the wig is wonderful enough to bump it up to a 6', '2015-01-10 07:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7300838, 1138517, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very visually engaging.</td>', 'Very visually engaging.', '2015-01-10 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
